    b. Identify modified versions and describe the material changes,
       without implying approval by the original author or by Canon.

    c. Distribute the covered original material and Your modifications
       under this License, without adding terms that prevent recipients
       from exercising its permissions for that material. Every recipient
       receives the applicable grant directly from the relevant Licensors.

    d. When distributing compiled software, also provide recipients with
       the corresponding source for the Covered Work included in it,
       including Your modifications and the build instructions needed to
       reproduce that covered software. Source must be in the preferred
       form for making changes, not merely an obfuscated representation.
       Include it with the distribution or make it available to recipients
       for download at no additional charge when distributing the binary.

Private modifications need not be published if You do not redistribute them.
This License does not require disclosure of independent software solely
because it exchanges commands or data with CanonXL. It grants no copyright
claim over independently created images, measurements or other output.
Use of the Covered Work to supply commercial output remains Commercial Use.

